cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "par2-circadian: AR(2) eigenvalue analysis for gene expression time series"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the method preprint below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Michael
    family-names: Whiteside
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-0643-5791"
abstract: >-
  Fits second-order autoregressive models to gene expression time series and
  extracts the eigenvalue modulus of the characteristic polynomial as a scalar
  measure of temporal persistence, recovering the Clock > Target > Background
  hierarchy in circadian datasets.
version: 1.1.5
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mickwh2764/par2discovery"
url: "https://par2discovery.com"
keywords:
  - circadian rhythms
  - gene expression
  - autoregressive modelling
  - AR(2)
  - eigenvalue modulus
  - temporal persistence
  - chronobiology
  - time-series analysis
preferred-citation:
